dapo-nemo-rl patch for NeMo-RL (https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL), base tag v0.7.0, after 0001.
Lets the NemoGym actor post rows to Gym agents started elsewhere
(env.nemo_gym.remote_agent_urls, by agent name) instead of starting Gym itself.
Applied by dapo_nemo_rl/run_trainer.py with `git apply`, which skips this header.
Upstream code: Apache-2.0, NVIDIA CORPORATION.

